WEBVTT

00:04:58.765 --> 00:05:01.845
the right direction, the engine shut off,

00:05:01.845 --> 00:05:04.067
and we're weightless.

00:05:04.067 --> 00:05:06.969
And we're alive.

00:05:06.969 --> 00:05:08.425
It's an amazing experience.

00:05:08.425 --> 00:05:11.733
But why would we take that risk?

00:05:11.733 --> 00:05:15.453
Why would you do something that dangerous?

00:05:15.453 --> 00:05:17.522
In my case the answer is fairly straightforward.

00:05:17.522 --> 00:05:20.576
I was inspired as a youngster

00:05:20.576 --> 00:05:22.167
that this was what I wanted to do.

00:05:22.167 --> 00:05:24.360
I watched the first people walk on the moon

00:05:24.360 --> 00:05:26.591
and to me, it was just an obvious thing --

00:05:26.591 --> 00:05:29.593
I want to somehow turn myself into that.

00:05:29.593 --> 00:05:30.775
But the real question is,